+    # 22. H.264/AVC In-Loop Adaptive Deblocking Filter & Binary Arithmetic (CABAC) Lossless Roundtrip
+    # 8-pixel line across a 4x4 block boundary [p3, p2, p1, p0 | q0, q1, q2, q3]
