+    # 24. Horn-Schunck Global Variational Optical Flow Euler-Lagrange Gauss-Seidel Solver
+    # Uniform Brightness Gradient I(x,y,t) = 2*(x - u_true*t) + 3*(y - v_true*t) with u_true=1.5, v_true=-0.5
+    # Then I_x = 2.0, I_y = 3.0, I_t = -(I_x*u_true + I_y*v_true) = -(3.0 - 1.5) = -1.5
